# NAME
#        secrets.env — real API tokens for the egress proxy
#
# SYNOPSIS
#        NAME=token
#
# DESCRIPTION
#        One NAME=token per line. A line appears here for every secret config.toml declares,
#        leaving you the token to fill in. The proxy swaps in the matching token on egress,
#        keyed on the destination host, and a rotated token takes effect on the next request.
#
#        The only copy of the real tokens, held outside the workspace and never mounted into it.
#
# EXAMPLES
#        ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=...
#        MISTRAL_API_KEY=...
#        OPENAI_API_KEY=...
#
# SEE ALSO
#        config.toml — its `secret` entries name these tokens.
